(6113188, 901233, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept here. Wish the image were a bit sharper.</td>', 'I really like the concept here. Wish the image were a bit sharper.', '2010-08-02 09:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113189, 901139, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the low key!!</td>', 'Love the low key!!', '2010-08-02 09:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113190, 901152, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the subtlety.</td>', 'I love the subtlety.', '2010-08-02 09:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113192, 901219, 66597, '<td valign="top">Wish there was less sky here, but do really like the plains area</td>', 'Wish there was less sky here, but do really like the plains area', '2010-08-02 10:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113194, 900742, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think a single bird would have been more minimimalistic although I love them in their various stages of flight.</td>', 'I think a single bird would have been more minimimalistic although I love them in their various stages of flight.', '2010-08-02 10:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113195, 900077, 15711, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I love low key!!!</td>', 'Well done.  I love low key!!!', '2010-08-02 10:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113209, 900503, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this. Hate the title without spaces!<br/>Photographically, it really doesn''t show well to me.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this. Hate the title without spaces!Photographically, it really doesn''t show well to me.', '2010-08-02 10:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113300, 900614, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wel done black and white conversion. I like the deep blacks and bright whites. Good use of textures and depth of field.</td>', 'Wel done black and white conversion. I like the deep blacks and bright whites. Good use of textures and depth of field.', '2010-08-02 10:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113302, 901116, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good textures in the leaf. I wish the inside as also in focus (I cannot pinpoint why I would like to see that, it''s just how I''m feeling about the image).</td>', 'Good textures in the leaf. I wish the inside as also in focus (I cannot pinpoint why I would like to see that, it''s just how I''m feeling about the image).', '2010-08-02 10:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113305, 900641, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lines. I think the face is just too busy for this photo (if it were just the lines of the building, it would be much better, IMHO).</td>', 'Nice use of lines. I think the face is just too busy for this photo (if it were just the lines of the building, it would be much better, IMHO).', '2010-08-02 10:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113307, 901075, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice placement and composition. One thing that is drawing my eye which I don''t think should be drawing it is the line of light near the top of the photo.</td>', 'Nice placement and composition. One thing that is drawing my eye which I don''t think should be drawing it is the line of light near the top of the photo.', '2010-08-02 10:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113309, 900859, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice details and textures in the focus area. I''m just a little thrown by the B&amp;W conversion. I somehow wish there were more deeper blacks in the leaf itself to really bring out the contours.</td>', 'Nice details and textures in the focus area. I''m just a little thrown by the B&W conversion. I somehow wish there were more deeper blacks in the leaf itself to really bring out the contours.', '2010-08-02 10:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113314, 901153, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the use of reflections. But I would like to see more details in the leaf itself. Seems like the depth of field is so shallow, we can''t really see anything.</td>', 'I like the use of reflections. But I would like to see more details in the leaf itself. Seems like the depth of field is so shallow, we can''t really see anything.', '2010-08-02 11:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113317, 900290, 114225, '<td valign="top">My first reaction to this was "too bright." After examining it more closely, I do like the idea of high key for this. I would like to see textures in the fruit, but at the same time, not having them makes me see the lines more.</td>', 'My first reaction to this was "too bright." After examining it more closely, I do like the idea of high key for this. I would like to see textures in the fruit, but at the same time, not having them makes me see the lines more.', '2010-08-02 11:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113321, 901119, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing a lot of details on whatever this is. I think this could have done better without the bright object in the background.</td>', 'Nice job capturing a lot of details on whatever this is. I think this could have done better without the bright object in the background.', '2010-08-02 11:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113325, 900538, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the overall composition of this one. The snake just coming into the scene is well thought out. But I think if you would have used a less distracting background (probably darker), and no plant, this would have fit the theme better.</td>', 'I like the overall composition of this one. The snake just coming into the scene is well thought out. But I think if you would have used a less distracting background (probably darker), and no plant, this would have fit the theme better.', '2010-08-02 11:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113329, 900988, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of the literal minimalism (basic shapes and lines). This photo feels a bit like an optical illusion. I cannot tell if it''s 3d or 2d.</td>', 'Good use of the literal minimalism (basic shapes and lines). This photo feels a bit like an optical illusion. I cannot tell if it''s 3d or 2d.', '2010-08-02 11:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113330, 901138, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fun use of tiltshift. I''m not sure how much it falls into minimalism (in my eye).</td>', 'Fun use of tiltshift. I''m not sure how much it falls into minimalism (in my eye).', '2010-08-02 11:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113331, 900213, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. I feel it fits the theme well, as it''s simple, yet effective. Good details in the blade.</td>', 'I like this. I feel it fits the theme well, as it''s simple, yet effective. Good details in the blade.', '2010-08-02 11:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113334, 901232, 114225, '<td valign="top">To me, this seems to be the opposite of minimalism. It''s too bad, as this is a really wonderful shot for a different challenge!</td>', 'To me, this seems to be the opposite of minimalism. It''s too bad, as this is a really wonderful shot for a different challenge!', '2010-08-02 11:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113336, 900344, 114225, '<td valign="top">Well done! Great use of lighting to just bring out the contours in the image.</td>', 'Well done! Great use of lighting to just bring out the contours in the image.', '2010-08-02 11:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113338, 901076, 114225, '<td valign="top">The way this photo draws your eyes naturally across the flower is really nice. For this theme, I would have liked to see it sans the vase.</td>', 'The way this photo draws your eyes naturally across the flower is really nice. For this theme, I would have liked to see it sans the vase.', '2010-08-02 11:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113340, 900721, 114225, '<td valign="top">To me, this doesn''t really scream "minimalism." Maybe if the same scene has a perfectly still water and blue skies, this would fit better (in my eyes).</td>', 'To me, this doesn''t really scream "minimalism." Maybe if the same scene has a perfectly still water and blue skies, this would fit better (in my eyes).', '2010-08-02 11:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113344, 900730, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the sharp focus across the entire stem. Good details and good separation from the background.</td>', 'I like the sharp focus across the entire stem. Good details and good separation from the background.', '2010-08-02 11:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6113345, 900499, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely done B&amp;W conversion. I like the deep black of the boat contrasted against the light water.</td>', 'Nicely done B&W conversion. I like the deep black of the boat contrasted against the light water.', '2010-08-02 11:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
