(6114127, 901090, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Wonderful macro and great details, which is why it doesn''t really meet Minimalism for me.</td>', 'Wow.  Wonderful macro and great details, which is why it doesn''t really meet Minimalism for me.', '2010-08-02 18:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
