(6116809, 900142, 93565, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot; I like how the background isn''t a uniform black, but a rather mottled grey.</td>', 'Interesting shot; I like how the background isn''t a uniform black, but a rather mottled grey.', '2010-08-04 04:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
