(6121594, 901038, 94241, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, I can not stand halos on objects.  I think it almost works here in this uber-contrasted black and white.  But I still ultimately get bugged by the halos.</td>', 'I have to admit, I can not stand halos on objects.  I think it almost works here in this uber-contrasted black and white.  But I still ultimately get bugged by the halos.', '2010-08-07 09:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121598, 900109, 94241, '<td valign="top">I feel the moon is a tad overexposed and lacking detail.</td>', 'I feel the moon is a tad overexposed and lacking detail.', '2010-08-07 09:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121611, 900589, 94241, '<td valign="top">Err, sorry to nit-pick, but calling this binary sort of breaks my brain.  You''ve got three states.  0, 1, 2.  That''s not binary.  Or you''ve got three states of an implied four states.  0/0, 1/0, 1/1, (0/1).  That is arguably binary, but not minimalism because you then would have more than one bit and I think anything over one bit can''t be called minimal.</td>', 'Err, sorry to nit-pick, but calling this binary sort of breaks my brain.  You''ve got three states.  0, 1, 2.  That''s not binary.  Or you''ve got three states of an implied four states.  0/0, 1/0, 1/1, (0/1).  That is arguably binary, but not minimalism because you then would have more than one bit and I think anything over one bit can''t be called minimal.', '2010-08-07 09:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121700, 901206, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like it but I would hopr to see a bit more contrast. Nice composition though!</td>', 'I like it but I would hopr to see a bit more contrast. Nice composition though!', '2010-08-07 11:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121702, 901106, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the subject. I like the border. I think the feel is nice. The house texture is ok as a contrast. Nice work.</td>', 'I like the subject. I like the border. I think the feel is nice. The house texture is ok as a contrast. Nice work.', '2010-08-07 11:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121703, 900990, 12611, '<td valign="top">VEry well done; it has a nice moving slow grace to it and it is somehow emotion- filled? for lack of a better term. very nice.</td>', 'VEry well done; it has a nice moving slow grace to it and it is somehow emotion- filled? for lack of a better term. very nice.', '2010-08-07 11:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121704, 900553, 12611, '<td valign="top">At first I thought "why the religious title"? But now I see lord does not mean that type pf lord. I really dig the composition and darkest and whitest elements in the proverbial sweet spot of the photo. Perhaps more contrast, perhaps there is more than enough?</td>', 'At first I thought "why the religious title"? But now I see lord does not mean that type pf lord. I really dig the composition and darkest and whitest elements in the proverbial sweet spot of the photo. Perhaps more contrast, perhaps there is more than enough?', '2010-08-07 11:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121706, 900582, 12611, '<td valign="top">better than average; nicely abstract and gnarled.</td>', 'better than average; nicely abstract and gnarled.', '2010-08-07 11:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121709, 900530, 12611, '<td valign="top">I was not much of a fan of the composition, but I really can''t ignore th egreat powdery texture of the cup, the smoothness of the hands, YOu can almost feel them from looking at the photo. great job; well above average- with the right composition you would have a blue ribbon, otherwise, its still good.</td>', 'I was not much of a fan of the composition, but I really can''t ignore th egreat powdery texture of the cup, the smoothness of the hands, YOu can almost feel them from looking at the photo. great job; well above average- with the right composition you would have a blue ribbon, otherwise, its still good.', '2010-08-07 11:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121711, 901231, 12611, '<td valign="top">The title is really good. I like the shot but better without the people? despite the double-entendred methaphorical title?</td>', 'The title is really good. I like the shot but better without the people? despite the double-entendred methaphorical title?', '2010-08-07 11:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121714, 900113, 12611, '<td valign="top">This looks like a winner, a full on top three, based upon composition, title, etc; but is it really good or formulaic? it sure fits the mold of a prize winning shot.</td>', 'This looks like a winner, a full on top three, based upon composition, title, etc; but is it really good or formulaic? it sure fits the mold of a prize winning shot.', '2010-08-07 12:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121717, 901189, 12611, '<td valign="top">sweet.</td>', 'sweet.', '2010-08-07 12:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121718, 900646, 12611, '<td valign="top">Somehow there is a feminine curve quality to these lines; this is a great shot; great use of vertical and contrast. A winner imho.</td>', 'Somehow there is a feminine curve quality to these lines; this is a great shot; great use of vertical and contrast. A winner imho.', '2010-08-07 12:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121720, 901219, 12611, '<td valign="top">You have the horizon dead center, and that distracts form the quality of the shot; you must recompose this. Crop it right above the whitest cloud rendering thirds. best of luck.</td>', 'You have the horizon dead center, and that distracts form the quality of the shot; you must recompose this. Crop it right above the whitest cloud rendering thirds. best of luck.', '2010-08-07 12:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121724, 900988, 12611, '<td valign="top">Is this a bit too dead center, I mean, you must ask yourself that. I love the contrast shape, serenity and zen of the form, but it seems to lack that final je ne sais quoi. (Still its superb amongst a field of technically proficient but absent of theme shots.)</td>', 'Is this a bit too dead center, I mean, you must ask yourself that. I love the contrast shape, serenity and zen of the form, but it seems to lack that final je ne sais quoi. (Still its superb amongst a field of technically proficient but absent of theme shots.)', '2010-08-07 12:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121725, 900643, 12611, '<td valign="top">You nailed the sky in this. I love the feeling. Meets challenge? who cares. Its good.</td>', 'You nailed the sky in this. I love the feeling. Meets challenge? who cares. Its good.', '2010-08-07 12:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121728, 900503, 12611, '<td valign="top">plus nine for the photo<br/>minus 8 for the title.<br/> <br/>Just kidding- keep pushing the boundaries, and perhaps a more random placement of the black square might work.</td>', 'plus nine for the photominus 8 for the title. Just kidding- keep pushing the boundaries, and perhaps a more random placement of the black square might work.', '2010-08-07 12:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121729, 900391, 12611, '<td valign="top">8 points for superb feel and motion in this abstract black and white shot.<br/>(Minus 400 for the ABBA quoted title.)</td>', '8 points for superb feel and motion in this abstract black and white shot.(Minus 400 for the ABBA quoted title.)', '2010-08-07 12:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121730, 901066, 12611, '<td valign="top">SO geometrically tasty. No criticisms here. JUst perfect.</td>', 'SO geometrically tasty. No criticisms here. JUst perfect.', '2010-08-07 12:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121732, 900511, 12611, '<td valign="top">Tasty shot; has a "don''t pay the ferryman feel" except for the distracting modern pole tops. Still its really good.</td>', 'Tasty shot; has a "don''t pay the ferryman feel" except for the distracting modern pole tops. Still its really good.', '2010-08-07 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121734, 900292, 12611, '<td valign="top">I understand the scarf is black, but perhaps a true minimalist would forgo the scarf altogether in exchange for the highest of scores and adulations.</td>', 'I understand the scarf is black, but perhaps a true minimalist would forgo the scarf altogether in exchange for the highest of scores and adulations.', '2010-08-07 12:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121891, 900460, 23484, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Nice high contrast look.</td>', 'Cool idea. Nice high contrast look.', '2010-08-07 14:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121893, 901134, 23484, '<td valign="top">This image really has a way of drawing the eye in. Nice B&amp;W.</td>', 'This image really has a way of drawing the eye in. Nice B&W.', '2010-08-07 14:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121894, 901029, 23484, '<td valign="top">I think the very low contrast works well here.</td>', 'I think the very low contrast works well here.', '2010-08-07 14:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121895, 901027, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very abstract looking. So many lines. Nice job.</td>', 'Very abstract looking. So many lines. Nice job.', '2010-08-07 14:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121896, 901090, 23484, '<td valign="top">The perspective makes this an interesting shot. The lead looks so compressed.</td>', 'The perspective makes this an interesting shot. The lead looks so compressed.', '2010-08-07 14:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121897, 901091, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent job on the lighting and composition.</td>', 'Excellent job on the lighting and composition.', '2010-08-07 14:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121898, 901092, 23484, '<td valign="top">Neat shot of the everyday mundane life.</td>', 'Neat shot of the everyday mundane life.', '2010-08-07 14:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121899, 901007, 23484, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice execution. Love the negative space.</td>', 'Good idea and nice execution. Love the negative space.', '2010-08-07 14:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6121925, 901216, 554, '<td valign="top">worked on the lighting till you got it perfect didn''t you?</td>', 'worked on the lighting till you got it perfect didn''t you?', '2010-08-07 15:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6122390, 900321, 76335, '<td valign="top">The textures might be too busy to categorize this as minimalism. But it''s an excellent image on its own terms.</td>', 'The textures might be too busy to categorize this as minimalism. But it''s an excellent image on its own terms.', '2010-08-08 00:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6122397, 900498, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice. Blow up that frame!</td>', 'Nice. Blow up that frame!', '2010-08-08 00:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6122415, 901225, 76335, '<td valign="top">Quiet and zen-like, but not really minimal. Challenge aside, it''s a beautiful image. I love monochrome flowers.</td>', 'Quiet and zen-like, but not really minimal. Challenge aside, it''s a beautiful image. I love monochrome flowers.', '2010-08-08 00:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6122941, 900647, 12674, '<td valign="top">Impressionistic, different, and I like it!</td>', 'Impressionistic, different, and I like it!', '2010-08-08 11:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6123064, 901038, 81362, '<td valign="top">I like the composition generally: "T" shape, single shirt, 2 lines, few holders, all against sky/cloud texture. Air drying is a kind of minimal approach to living. Unfortunately, the halos around the pole and shirt, whether from sharpening technique or other processing, knock this down several noches for me.</td>', 'I like the composition generally: "T" shape, single shirt, 2 lines, few holders, all against sky/cloud texture. Air drying is a kind of minimal approach to living. Unfortunately, the halos around the pole and shirt, whether from sharpening technique or other processing, knock this down several noches for me.', '2010-08-08 13:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6123085, 901162, 76335, '<td valign="top">Gritty and very interesting. But minimal?</td>', 'Gritty and very interesting. But minimal?', '2010-08-08 14:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6123088, 901204, 76335, '<td valign="top">I have trouble calling this minimal. But challenge aside, I asbolutlely love the image. The way you''ve framed and composed this is fantastic.</td>', 'I have trouble calling this minimal. But challenge aside, I asbolutlely love the image. The way you''ve framed and composed this is fantastic.', '2010-08-08 14:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6123121, 901207, 118396, '<td valign="top">Great picture (and great message!).</td>', 'Great picture (and great message!).', '2010-08-08 15:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6123122, 900109, 118396, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!</td>', 'Awesome shot!', '2010-08-08 15:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6123124, 901092, 76335, '<td valign="top">All the quietude of a living area in the wee hours. Great.</td>', 'All the quietude of a living area in the wee hours. Great.', '2010-08-08 15:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6123125, 901071, 118396, '<td valign="top">I have a drama queen daughter that would LOVE this.  Fun!</td>', 'I have a drama queen daughter that would LOVE this.  Fun!', '2010-08-08 15:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6123134, 901188, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like your composition. I would like the image better with a smoother background.</td>', 'I like your composition. I would like the image better with a smoother background.', '2010-08-08 15:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6123135, 900582, 66384, '<td valign="top">This seems quite busy for minimalism.</td>', 'This seems quite busy for minimalism.', '2010-08-08 15:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
