(6124064, 900988, 55283, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> I love the title. I don''t know if you coined the word yourself: it is not entirely absent from the Internet but is awfully obscure even so.<br/> <br/>I like it applied to Minimalism. I think that''s a wonderful goal for this movement: to create some sort of basic unit of imagery. This title/concept brings out the strength of your image: its boldness. You''ve risked being too simple, and not original enough, in order to achieve this boldness. I think it works. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I coined and then searched to see if it existed. <a href="//books.google.com/books?id=ocgNvcvYc9gC&amp;pg=PA337&amp;lpg=PA337&amp;dq=photeme&amp;source=bl&amp;ots=BFiPrap4B7&amp;sig=6PmglFQsUDLbEoJAszl-5TH0z3E&amp;hl=en&amp;ei=2oBfTOi8E8L68Ab4yN3DDQ&amp;sa=X&amp;oi=book_result&amp;ct=result&amp;resnum=4&amp;ved=0CB8Q6AEwAw#v=onepage&amp;q=photeme&amp;f=false" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">This</a> was what convinced me to go ahead and use it. I was afraid it might be either too pretentious or just a detriment for lack of Webster''s documentation.  Thank you for taking interest enough to look into it.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: I love the title. I don''t know if you coined the word yourself: it is not entirely absent from the Internet but is awfully obscure even so. I like it applied to Minimalism. I think that''s a wonderful goal for this movement: to create some sort of basic unit of imagery. This title/concept brings out the strength of your image: its boldness. You''ve risked being too simple, and not original enough, in order to achieve this boldness. I think it works.  I coined and then searched to see if it existed. This was what convinced me to go ahead and use it. I was afraid it might be either too pretentious or just a detriment for lack of Webster''s documentation.  Thank you for taking interest enough to look into it.', '2010-08-09 01:19:19.000000', NULL, 0),
