(6124193, 900503, 69325, '<td valign="top">I simply do not understand why you do what you do. You are, by all accounts a talented photographer. And since you seem to purposely go for the brown with these shots I don''t give you the benefit of the doubt, as though you are being avant garde or pushing the boundaries or any such thing. I am guessing it just makes you laugh, and look at me, it got my longest comment of the challenge, so what do I know?</td>', 'I simply do not understand why you do what you do. You are, by all accounts a talented photographer. And since you seem to purposely go for the brown with these shots I don''t give you the benefit of the doubt, as though you are being avant garde or pushing the boundaries or any such thing. I am guessing it just makes you laugh, and look at me, it got my longest comment of the challenge, so what do I know?', '2010-08-09 02:51:05.000000', NULL, 0),
