(6124338, 901090, 114682, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the votes and comments. The score has been stable around 5,94 all the week, to dropp only in the last few hours. Nevertheless I''m happy with the result and I like my image. <br/>To LevT: I have never seen techo''s picture before you mentioned it to me, believe it or not. I had one outtake with only the book, but it looked a little bit empty and too simple, kind of flat. Then I added a pencil and was happy with the result. It''s relly great to see that we both had the same idea, mine came, though some years after.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-08-09 08:09:04.</i></td>', 'Thank you for the votes and comments. The score has been stable around 5,94 all the week, to dropp only in the last few hours. Nevertheless I''m happy with the result and I like my image. To LevT: I have never seen techo''s picture before you mentioned it to me, believe it or not. I had one outtake with only the book, but it looked a little bit empty and too simple, kind of flat. Then I added a pencil and was happy with the result. It''s relly great to see that we both had the same idea, mine came, though some years after.', '2010-08-09 08:59:52.000000', '2010-08-09 09:09:04.000000', 0),
