(6125656, 900609, 32011, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO).<br/> <br/>Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/> <br/> <br/>Top 20, and a 6.1... got some love but truly expected this to finish higher (along with the other MUAIMHOs).  Composition is king in challenges like this, and commenting just now on all the MUAIMHOs I noticed that they''ve all absolutely nailed the composition, and this image too has got the composition spot-on.  Congratulations on a wonderful image... thank you for sharing it with us.</td>', 'This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO). Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)  Top 20, and a 6.1... got some love but truly expected this to finish higher (along with the other MUAIMHOs).  Composition is king in challenges like this, and commenting just now on all the MUAIMHOs I noticed that they''ve all absolutely nailed the composition, and this image too has got the composition spot-on.  Congratulations on a wonderful image... thank you for sharing it with us.', '2010-08-10 09:54:46.000000', NULL, 0),
