(6125698, 901161, 32321, '<td valign="top">Hi Diane!<br/>Just checking up on the team mates!<br/>I really like this picture, and I like the play on words! (I got it!)<br/>Nice lighting, pose and good capture of her eyes.<br/>I guess there are too many prudes who thought you were trying to shoehorn a nude shot. Its odd you only got two comments!<br/>I have not entered a challenge since the league closed. Too busy and I got nailed taking pictures just to enter the challenge. I guess Im waiting to be inspired again. <br/>Take care<br/>Bruce<br/></td>', 'Hi Diane!Just checking up on the team mates!I really like this picture, and I like the play on words! (I got it!)Nice lighting, pose and good capture of her eyes.I guess there are too many prudes who thought you were trying to shoehorn a nude shot. Its odd you only got two comments!I have not entered a challenge since the league closed. Too busy and I got nailed taking pictures just to enter the challenge. I guess Im waiting to be inspired again. Take careBruce', '2010-08-10 10:25:37.000000', NULL, 0),
