(6687616, 900598, 36499, '<td valign="top">the serenity of this shot really touches me. i would love to see what this might look like with some dodging n burning of the grasses n sky. i think you could really create a dramatic effect with this one. let e know if you ever redo it. have a great day!<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'the serenity of this shot really touches me. i would love to see what this might look like with some dodging n burning of the grasses n sky. i think you could really create a dramatic effect with this one. let e know if you ever redo it. have a great day!~~Cher~~', '2012-02-22 18:01:35.000000', NULL, 0),
